.TH tkutical n 0.2 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkutical \- calendar widget (month/week, tical-backed)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkutical
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkutical::widget .w ?-view month|week?]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Canvas calendar widget backed by the tical engine: month or week view, optional
week numbers and holidays, none|single|multiple day selection, prev/next/today
navigation. Optional widget (requires tical; not in the tkutils umbrella). See
docs/tkutical.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tical(n), tkutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, calendar, week
